source_raw_tex:
\eqalign{\tau(u)\ge\int u\times v
&=c^{-p/q}\int\sgn u\times|u|\times\sgn u\times|u|^{p/q}\cr
&=c^{-p/q}\int|u|^{1+{p\over q}}
=c^{-p/q}\int|u|^p
=c^{p-{p\over q}}
=c,\cr}

