source_raw_tex:
\eqalignno{(\int f)^{1/p}&\ge h(f_1^{\ssbullet})
=\int g\times f_1=\int|g\times f^{1/p}|\cr
&\ge\int f^{1/q}\times f^{1/p}\cr
\noalign{\noindent (because $0\le f^{1/q}\leae|g|$)}
&=\int f,\cr}

